    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tech Blast tells the story of a girl stranded on a mysterious planet filled with dangerous insects and the ruins of an ancient civilization. Explore the complex, solve puzzles, and build mechanisms to survive and find a way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action and puzzles in a unique sci-fi atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building mechanisms and interacting with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against ore insects and using a robot to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncovering the mysteries of the abandoned complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring different corners of the planet and collecting resources for survival.</p>",
